  "job_B1.5.6_20251001_193248": {
    "chunk_text": "Erat quidam regulus cuius filius infirmabatur Capharnaum & reliqua, Ure H\u00e6lend com hwilon to \u00d0a w\u00e6s sum underkyng on Capharnan burig, & his sune \u00f0a l\u00e6g seoc to for\u00f0fore. \u00d0a axode \u00fee underkyng embe \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes f\u00e6r, \u00fe\u00e6t he from Iudea londe com to Galileam, ferde \u00fea to \u00dea andswarde \u00fee H\u00e6lend \u00feus \u00f0am underkynge, Buton ge tacne iseon, nelle ge ilyf\u00e6n. \u00dee underkyng him andswarde eft, La, leof Drihten, fare to mine sune \u00e6r \u00fean \u00f0e he sw\u00e6lte. \u00d0e H\u00e6lend him cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feus to, Fare \u00f0e nu on \u00feinne w\u00e6g; \u00fein sune leof\u00e6\u00f0. \u00d0a ilyfde \u00fee kyng \u00f0\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes sp\u00e6ce, & wende him hamweard, & hopode to \u00fean. \u00d0a comen \u00f0\u00e6s on maregen his men him togeanes & cydden him mid blisse \u00fe\u00e6t his sune leofede. \u00d0e f\u00e6der heom befran \u00fea mid fyrwetnysse son\u00e6, on hwylcere tide \u00fee sune gewurpte. Heo s\u00e6den him to andsware, Gyrst\u00e6nd\u00e6g he wurpte; swa ofer midne d\u00e6g, \u00fe\u00e6t hine forlet \u00feeo fefor. \u00dea oncneow \u00fee f\u00e6der \u00fe\u00e6t hine forlet \u00fee fefor on \u00feare ylc\u00e6 tide \u00fee \u00f0e H\u00e6lend him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Fare \u00fee nu & he \u00fea sylf ilyfde, & all his hired \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6t. \u00d0is godspel is nu sceortlice is\u00e6d on Englisc, & we wull\u00e6\u00f0 eow s\u00e6cg\u00e6n sum andgit \u00feerto of \u00fe",
